		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「What do you think of writing your wish on a strip of paper?」
			PRINTFORML 「Actually, I've got some bamboo just for this occasion.」
			PRINTFORMDW You and Marisa each write a wish on a strip of paper and hang it on a bamboo branch...
			
