			PRINTFORML 「Oh, how the stars are twinkling, twinkling～♪ Gold and silver grains of sand～♪」
			PRINTFORML 「Five wishes I have written～♪ The stars are twinkling and watching from the sky～♪」
			PRINTFORMDW Marisa seems rather cheerful...
