		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Hmm～? That's odd, I didn't take you for a religious type.」
			PRINTFORML 「You keep surprising me every time%K11_ZE("daze",1)%, %CALLNAME:MASTER%!」
			PRINTFORML 「Well, I'll pray for my future success... And so that I continue being the protagonist...」
			PRINTFORMDW Marisa mumbles to herself something strange.
