		PRINTFORMW 「And then I have access to all the materials I need right here in the vicinity.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Not to mention I like to help out occasional outsiders popping in here from spots where the barrier is weak.」
		PRINTFORMW 「And of course there's Alice, who's been selflessly helping me with book donations. I definitely didn't steal a thing from her, no, never!」
